# Testing, Linting & Formatting

- **Testing**: Jest + RNTL; global mocks in `setupJest.ts`; use `react-native-testing` skill for test authoring.
- 🚨 **CONTINUOUS TESTING**: Update or add tests for every logic/UI change.
- **Linting**: Fix all ESLint errors in changed files.
- **Formatting**: Keep Prettier-formatted; hooks run `yarn format` automatically.
- **Quality gate**: Stop hooks run `yarn lint`, `yarn format`, `yarn test`, `yarn tsc` when workspace has changes.
- **Context drift**: After quality passes, drift check may suggest `/moonlit-context-curator` (user approval required).
